  "steps": [
    "Prepare the filling by mixing greek yogurt, cinnamon, PB, vanilla essence, monkfruit extract/ honey and set in the freezer to thicken for 15 mins.",
    "For the pancakes, blend oats and protein powder into a fine powder.",
    "Then add all thr reamining ingredients to the oats and protein powder mixture. Blend again until its well combined. The consistency should be a little thicker than a dosa batter.",
